    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d317-a14">

                <pb facs="0475" n="401" xml:id="pg401"/>


                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Admiral Mendez to Mr. Villalon.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Headquarters of the Squadron of her
                                Catholic Majesty in the Pacific,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Frigate Numancia, Valparaiso,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-03-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 27. 1866<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>It devolving upon the vessels of my command to open fire upon Valparaiso on the
                    31st instant, I have the honor to inform your excellency thereof, thus complying
                    with a duty of humanity, so that the aged, the women, the children, and the
                    other non-combatants may place themselves in security. I likewise trust that
                    your excellency may be pleased to order that the hospitals and other buildings
                    dedicated to charitable purposes may have some flags or signal that may
                    distinguish them, so as to prevent them from suffering the rigors of war.</p>
                <p>God guard your excellency many days.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CASTO MENDEZ NUNEZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Commandant of Valparaiso.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
